tools.formula:
for each correctly-classified x: find x' = argmin ‖x' − x‖₂  s.t.  f(x') ≠ f(x)
   (HopSkipJump: binary search to the decision boundary + gradient estimate
    from label-only queries, within max_iter / max_eval budget)
adversarial_robustness = 1 − (#rows flipped / #rows attacked)
adversarial_perturbation_size = median over flipped rows of ‖x' − x‖₂ / √d

